# secrets
.env

# receipts are personal data — nothing from a real document enters git history.
# The fetch SCRIPT is committed, the downloaded receipts never are.
data/*
!data/*.py
inbox/
quarantine/
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.pdf
*.heic
# Sample receipts are generated by tests/fixtures.py, not stored.
tests/fixtures/
!docs/assets/*.png
# The published page shows the review screen, so those two screenshots have to
# be in the repo for GitHub Pages to serve them. They are pictures of a receipt
# generated by tests/fixtures.py - JOLLIBEE, made up, no real person's shopping.
# Regenerate with tools/screenshot.py; nothing else may be added to this folder.
!docs/img/review-light.png
!docs/img/review-dark.png

# the ledger itself
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite

# python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
